<title>USA: Boeing Co Q1 EPS rises.</title>
<headline>Boeing Co Q1 EPS rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>						1997	 1996</p>
<p>			     ($ in millions except per share data)</p>
<p>    Sales				  $7,318    $4,293</p>
<p>Net earnings:</p>
<p>	  With SVT accounting	    $377	$119</p>
<p>	  SVT after-tax credit	    $64	   -</p>
<p>	  Without SVT accounting	 $313	$119</p>
<p>Earnings per share:</p>
<p>	  With SVT accounting	   $1.09	$.35</p>
<p>	  Without SVT accounting	 $.87	$.35</p>
<p>Average shares (millions):</p>
<p>	  With SVT accounting	   347.4     344.8</p>
<p>	  Without SVT accounting	360.5     344.8</p>
<p>	  NOTE: Stated net earnings include a $64 million</p>
<p>cumulative adjustment to partially offset income charges in prior periods associated with the market value change of Boeing stock held by the ShareValue Trust (SVT).</p>
</text>
